        <section id="overview" class="py-3">
            <h2 class="pipe">Commercial & Residential Paving, Masonry & Site Work in Acton, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> provides high-ticket asphalt paving, <a href="/middlesex-county/hardscape-contractor-acton-ma">custom stone masonry</a>, and civil site excavation for homeowners and commercial property managers throughout <strong>Acton, Massachusetts</strong>. Operating in Middlesex County, site conditions require specialized subgrade engineering to counteract intense New England freeze-thaw cycles, high seasonal groundwater, and frost-heaving. Without dense-graded aggregate base compaction and proper sub-base drainage, driveway pavement and stone masonry walls quickly develop surface oxidation, shifting, and structural cracking. S. Phaneuf & Associates applies over 35 years of local contracting experience, using heavy vibratory compaction and MassDOT-grade hot mix asphalt to build long-lasting outdoor infrastructure across Acton.</p>
        </section>

