            <h2 class="pipe">Reliable Paving & Site Work Across Acton</h2>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates regularly executes residential driveway paving, drainage catch basin installations, and bluestone patio construction across Acton's diverse neighborhoods. In <strong>West Acton</strong>, crews handle custom driveway resurfacing and paver walkway installations near historic homes along West Acton Village, the Isaac Davis Monument & Birthplace, and properties bordering the Bruce Freeman Rail Trail. In <strong>Acton Center</strong>, the team manages heavy site excavation, commercial parking lot milling, and retaining wall construction near Acton Town Hall, Acton Memorial Library, and the Acton Arboretum. From deep sub-base prep to final surface rolling, S. Phaneuf & Associates ensures structural integrity on every project site in Acton.</p>
